
RocksDB 9.11 introduced DB::Open overloads taking std::unique_ptr<DB>*
and RocksDB 10.1 removed the ones taking DB**. Add a small helper that
picks the right overload at compile time so both old and new RocksDB
versions are supported.

diff --git a/namespace/ns_quarkdb/qclient/include/qclient/ParallelRocksDBPersistency.hh b/namespace/ns_quarkdb/qclient/include/qclient/ParallelRocksDBPersistency.hh
